# Flat UI Design System (June 2026)

## No gradients — ever

Do not add `linear-gradient`, `radial-gradient`, gradient text (`background-clip: text`), or ambient glow `::before`/`::after` orbs.

Use solid tokens instead:

- Chips: `background: var(--color-primary-50)` or `var(--color-secondary-50)`
- Accent bars: `background: var(--color-primary)` or `var(--color-secondary)`
- Surfaces: `white`, `var(--color-slate-50)`, `var(--color-surface)`

## Flat buttons

Source of truth: `src/app/styles/components/Button.css`

```css
/* ✅ GOOD — flat */
.btn--primary {
  background-color: var(--color-primary);
  box-shadow: none;
}
.btn--primary:hover {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-hover);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-btn-primary);
}
.btn--primary:active {
  opacity: 0.92;
  transform: scale(0.98);
}

/* ❌ BAD — 3D depth */
box-shadow: 0 3px 0 var(--btn-primary-depth);
transform: translateY(4px);
```

Apply the same flat pattern to cookie-consent, header nav active states, blog sidebar CTAs, and form back buttons.

## Card system

Defined in `src/app/styles/components/homepage.css`:

| Class | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `cs-result-card` | Featured 3-up cards (problems, client results, specialization block) |
| `cs-item` | Compact grid rows (services, case studies, industries) |
| `chip-primary` / `chip-secondary` | Category labels on result cards |
| `faq-item` + `FAQAccordion` | All FAQ sections |

Cards: white background, `1.5px solid` border, `border-radius: 14–20px`, `var(--elevation-1)` default, `var(--elevation-2|3)` on hover.

## Page CTAs

Use `PageCTASection` from `src/components/ui/PageCTASection/PageCTASection.jsx`:

- Homepage / solid green band: `solidPrimary` prop → `.page-cta--solid-primary`
- Inner pages: default light variant → `.page-cta--light`
- Dark navy variant: `dark` prop only when explicitly needed

No `home-cta-premium`, glass inner cards, or blur layers.
